Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat:=20=E5=A2=9E=E5=BC=BA=E8=87=AA=E5=8A=A8?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E5=AE=A1=E6=89=B9=E7=B3=BB=E7=BB=9F=EF=BC=8Cenhance=20permissi?=
 =?UTF-8?q?on=20reviewer=20functionality=20and=20transcript=20handling?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Exclude reviewer protocol request cells from the transcript to prevent them from being used as authorization evidence.
- Update session processor to preserve auto-review metadata during tool execution and error handling.
- Add tests to verify the correct rendering of auto-review results in various scenarios, including completed and errored shell tools.
- Refactor test utilities to support user messages and improve readability.
- Ensure that the permission reviewer prompt correctly displays the rationale and decision before the decision tool is invoked.

